{"4146650":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MUPO","steam_appid":4146650,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MUPO<\/strong>, <strong>a rhythm game with a unique twist.<\/strong><br><strong>Your keyboard isn’t just an input device<\/strong>, <strong>it’s the game itself.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit notes, build maps, and claim your spot on the leaderboard. <br>Can you master the toughest maps and rise above your friends to become the ultimate MUPO champion?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/d2a431bb91d3ba6a7f448b4b556a1a40.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Immersive Gameplay\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/d2a431bb91d3ba6a7f448b4b556a1a40.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO offers a smooth and immersive rhythm experience where you can enjoy the music in your own way. You can play songs in various difficulties and use modifiers to tailor the challenge to your own preference.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/cc0d51f941299356d1e63841aeffd2f0.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Community Creativity\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/cc0d51f941299356d1e63841aeffd2f0.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO thrives through its community. You can design and share your own maps, making the game a constantly evolving experience. The built-in level editor ensures there’s always new content to play and discover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/83799274719d2d4547ab07022fc5eb95.webp?t=1793890754\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/83799274719d2d4547ab07022fc5eb95.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Competition\" width=1170 height=195 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For anyone who likes a good challenge, MUPO features global leaderboards. Compete against friends and rhythm gamers worldwide, climb the rankings, and prove your skill.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/e55985f64eb2fe91f58fe9555d2f5f10.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Roadmap\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/e55985f64eb2fe91f58fe9555d2f5f10.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO will continue to evolve steadily and will expand with multiplayer modes, custom keyboard skins, and new layouts like Numpad, Arrow Keys, or a full 100% keyboard layout. Future updates will add more content and creative tools for a fully personalized rhythm experience.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MUPO<\/strong>, <strong>a rhythm game with a unique twist.<\/strong><br><strong>Your keyboard isn’t just an input device<\/strong>, <strong>it’s the game itself.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit notes, build maps, and claim your spot on the leaderboard. <br>Can you master the toughest maps and rise above your friends to become the ultimate MUPO champion?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/d2a431bb91d3ba6a7f448b4b556a1a40.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Immersive Gameplay\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/d2a431bb91d3ba6a7f448b4b556a1a40.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO offers a smooth and immersive rhythm experience where you can enjoy the music in your own way. You can play songs in various difficulties and use modifiers to tailor the challenge to your own preference.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/cc0d51f941299356d1e63841aeffd2f0.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Community Creativity\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/cc0d51f941299356d1e63841aeffd2f0.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO thrives through its community. You can design and share your own maps, making the game a constantly evolving experience. The built-in level editor ensures there’s always new content to play and discover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/83799274719d2d4547ab07022fc5eb95.webp?t=1793890754\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/83799274719d2d4547ab07022fc5eb95.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Competition\" width=1170 height=195 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For anyone who likes a good challenge, MUPO features global leaderboards. Compete against friends and rhythm gamers worldwide, climb the rankings, and prove your skill.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/e55985f64eb2fe91f58fe9555d2f5f10.poster.avif?t=1793890754\" aria-label=\"Roadmap\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/extras\/e55985f64eb2fe91f58fe9555d2f5f10.webm?t=1793890754\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUPO will continue to evolve steadily and will expand with multiplayer modes, custom keyboard skins, and new layouts like Numpad, Arrow Keys, or a full 100% keyboard layout. Future updates will add more content and creative tools for a fully personalized rhythm experience.<\/p>","short_description":"Grab your keyboard and jump into the rhythm in MUPO. This fast-paced rhythm game is driven by skill, creativity, and community. Build maps, climb leaderboards, and shape the game’s future. And there’s so much more to come, stay tuned. Be part of the MUPO journey!","supported_languages":"English, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/45193bdaa94fe83ec00b0360b98b81610e7c3741\/header.jpg?t=1793890754","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/1fba4b369e93bcda34bf5f2d9760352bc583dd81\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793890754","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4146650\/1fba4b369e93bcda34bf5f2d9760352bc583dd81\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793890754","website":"https:\/\/mupo.app","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-Core<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Monterey 12 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1\/Silicon or Intel<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"li